All machines are running Ultrix 3.1.

Heres the scenario:

machine A is a uVAX II with a DEQNA ethernet board.
machine B is a uVAX 3800 with a DESQA (rev. D03) ethernet board.  They 
are connected at the same DELNI and there are no filters anywhere
on the network.  There is a network analyzer also connected at the
same DELNI multi-port.

