If I put the DEQNA in machine B, it works perfect.  I can't put the
DESQA in machine A to test it because it has the rivoted face plate
on the front which prevents it from fitting in the uVAX II.

Has anyone else had any problem with a board (the DESQA in particular)
allowing local traffic but closing its eyes to incoming ouside traffic?

