  I'm mildly doubtfull **if the server is functioning as a workstation at the
same time**.  Using somewhat slower RZ56's we found a combined
station/fileserver was not giving good performance with three disks, bud did
give good performance with a pair of Wrens.
  I didn't measure anything, so I don't know for sure what ``knee'' we hit,
